cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BSSCL-GBM: Hybrid Histogram Gradient Boosting Machine"
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Bhaskar
repository-code: "https://github.com/Bhaskar19chowdary/bsscl-gbm"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/bsscl-gbm/"
abstract: >-
  BSSCL-GBM is a highly memory-efficient, pure-Python implementation of Gradient Boosting Trees optimized with Numba. It features hybrid uint8 histogram binning, native handling of missing values, and automatic `balanced_sqrt` class weights for highly skewed and imbalanced tabular datasets.
keywords:
  - machine learning
  - gradient boosting
  - decision trees
  - numba
  - class imbalance
license: Apache-2.0
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-08-21
